@startuml

' 概念クラス図から移植してきた奴ら
' 各クラスの上のコメントは、概念クラス図での名前と属性 (上から順)

' 従業員: 氏名, 従業員ID, パスワード
class "User" as user {
  - name : string
  - userId : string
  - password : string
}

' 権限
abstract class "Role" as role

' マスタ管理者
class "MasterDataManager" as mdMan

' 勤怠管理者
class "AttendanceManager" as attMan

' 所属単位: 名称
class "OrganizationUnit" as orgUnit {
  - name : string
}

' シフト対象受付期間: 対象期間開始日, 対象期間終了日, 受付期間開始日時, 受付期間終了日時
class "ShiftPreferencePeriod" as spp {
  - targetStartDate : date
  - targetEndDate : date
  - acceptanceStartAt : datetime
  - acceptanceEndAt : datetime
}

' 通知: 内容, 作成日時
class "Notification" as notif {
  - content : string
  - createdAt : datetime
}

' 勤怠記録: 対象日
class "AttendanceRecord" as attRec {
  - targetDate : date
}

' 打刻: 打刻種類[出勤,退勤,休憩開始,休憩終了], 打刻日時
class "Punch" as punch {
  - type[clockIn, clockOut, breakStart, breakEnd] : string
  - punchedAt : datetime
}

' 勤怠修正申請: 対象日, 申請理由, 送信日時, 処理状態[未処理,承認済,却下,取り下げ], 却下理由, 修正後の勤怠
' 「修正後の勤怠」の型 []勤怠管理 は概念クラス図の表記のまま。図に「勤怠管理」というクラスは無い
class "AttendanceCorrectionRequest" as attCorReq {
  - targetDate : date
  - requestReason : string
  - submittedAt : datetime
  - status[pending, approved, rejected, withdrawn] : int
  - rejectionReason : string
  - correctedAttendance : []勤怠管理
}

' 勤怠修正履歴: 修正前内容, 修正日時, 修正理由
class "AttendanceCorrectionHistory" as attCorHist {
  - previousContent : string
  - correctedAt : datetime
  - correctionReason : string
}

' シフト希望: 希望日, 希望開始時刻, 希望終了時刻, 送信日時, 処理状態[下書き,未処理,承認済,却下,取り下げ], 却下理由
class "ShiftPreference" as shiftPref {
  - preferredDate : date
  - preferredStartTime : time
  - preferredEndTime : time
  - submittedAt : datetime
  - status[draft, pending, approved, rejected, withdrawn] : string
  - rejectionReason : string
}

' シフト: 勤務日, 開始時刻, 終了時刻, 状態[下書き,公開]
class "Shift" as shift {
  - workDate : date
  - startTime : time
  - endTime : time
  - status[draft, published] : string
}

' シフト日時変更申請: 変更後勤務日, 変更後開始時刻, 変更後終了時刻, 申請理由, 送信日時, 処理状態[未処理,承認済,却下,取り下げ], 却下理由
class "ShiftRescheduleRequest" as shiftReSchedReq {
  - newWorkDate : date
  - newStartTime : time
  - newEndTime : time
  - requestReason : string
  - submittedAt : datetime
  - status[pending, approved, rejected, withdrawn] : string
  - rejectionReason : string
}

' シフト変更履歴: 変更前内容, 操作日時
class "ShiftChangeHistory" as shiftChHist{
  - previousContent : string
  - operatedAt : datetime
}

' シフト削除履歴: 操作日時, 削除シフト日時, 削除理由
class "ShiftDeletionHistory" as shiftDelHist {
  - operatedAt : datetime
  - deletedShiftDateTime : string
  - deletionReason : string
}

' 汎化
"MasterDataManager" --|> "Role"
"AttendanceManager" --|> "Role"

' 関連 (多重度は概念クラス図のまま)
"User" "1" -- "0..2" "Role"
"User" "0..*" -- "0..1" "OrganizationUnit"
"AttendanceManager" "0..*" -- "0..*" "OrganizationUnit"
"OrganizationUnit" "1" -- "0..*" "ShiftPreferencePeriod"

"User" "1" -- "0..*" "Notification"

"User" "1" -- "0..*" "AttendanceRecord"
"User" "1" -- "0..*" "AttendanceCorrectionRequest"
"User" "1" -- "0..*" "AttendanceCorrectionHistory"
"AttendanceRecord" "1" -- "0..*" "Punch"
"AttendanceRecord" "0..1" -- "0..*" "AttendanceCorrectionRequest"
"AttendanceRecord" "1" -- "0..*" "AttendanceCorrectionHistory"

"User" "1" -- "0..*" "ShiftPreference"
"User" "1" -- "0..*" "Shift"
"User" "1" -- "0..*" "ShiftChangeHistory"
"User" "1" -- "0..*" "ShiftDeletionHistory"
"ShiftPreference" "0..1" -- "0..1" "Shift"
"Shift" "1" -- "0..*" "ShiftRescheduleRequest"
"Shift" "1" -- "0..*" "ShiftChangeHistory"
"Shift" "1" -- "0..1" "ShiftDeletionHistory"

' ノート
note "処理状態メモ\n却下：勤怠管理者\n取り下げ：従業員" as StatusMemo
note right of "AttendanceRecord" : 日次の勤怠記録

@enduml
